<title>FINLAND: Rauma falls sharply after 8-mth report.</title>
<headline>Rauma falls sharply after 8-mth report.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy fell sharply after posting lower than expected January-August profits on Thursday but trade was slow, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1545/1245 GMT, Rauma traded at 86.50 markka, down 4.50 markka or almost five percent. Trade was thin.</p>
<p>Rauma earlier released its eight-month report showing a 427 million markka profit after financial items, well below analysts' 485 million markka median forecast, but up from 369 million markka in the first eight months of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
